% The languages of the format of the T6 trial: English only (the design of
% the tex stage). babel's hyphen.cfg reads this file when the format builds.
english hyphen.tex % do not change!
=usenglish
=USenglish
=american
dumylang	dumyhyph.tex    % for testing a new language.
nohyphenation	zerohyph.tex    % a language with no patterns at all.
